OL,3,GNEWSACouncil in government talks over  
OL,4,Abudget shortfall                       
OL,6,FA council has been in "early           
OL,7,Fdiscussions with the government" to    
OL,8,Faddress a potential significant budget 
OL,9,Fshortfall in the next financial year,  
OL,10,Faccording to its leader.               
OL,12,FWest Northamptonshire Council said its 
OL,13,Ffinancial problems were caused by the  
OL,14,Frising demand of adult and children's  
OL,15,Fsocial care.                           
OL,17,FMark Arnull, the leader of the Reform  
OL,18,FUK-led council, said: "Like councils   
OL,19,Facross the country, we continue to face
OL,20,Fsignificant financial pressures and are
OL,21,Fexploring a range of measures for      
OL,22,Fsavings and efficiencies."             
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
