OL,3,GNEWSACouncil in government talks over  
OL,4,Abudget shortfall                       
OL,6,FThe council has opened a voluntary     
OL,7,Fredundancy window for its staff "ahead 
OL,8,Fof our draft budget proposals for the  
OL,9,Fnext financial year", he added.        
